<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<annex id="별표6" gubun="별표" no="6" title="실내공간정보 속성입력" source="https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/flDownload.do?flSeq=111000039">
  <text>[별표 6] 실내공간정보 속성입력
가. 주요속성값</text>
  <table rows="20" cols="4">
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="0">컬럼명(컬럼ID)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="0">타입</cell>
      <cell col="2" row="0">길이</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="0">입력값</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="1">①기본키(PRIMARY KEY)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="1">CHAR</cell>
      <cell col="2" row="1">41</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="1">③+“_”+⑩</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="2">②참조키(FOREIGN KEY)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="2"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="2">38</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="2">3차원객체코드</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="3">③레이어(LAYER)ID</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="3"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="3">35</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="3">레이어코드</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="4">④건물 ID</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="4"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="4">17</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="4">UFID(공간객체등록번호)</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="5">⑤층(FLOOR)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="5"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="5">6</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="5">지하1층 → “B01B01”,  지상1층 →“F01F01”,  로비층 → “L01L01”
지하1층지상1층 → “B01F01”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="6">⑥구분(DIVISION)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="6"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="6">2</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="6">이동 → “MV”,  안내 →“IF”,  편의 → “CV”, 운수 → “TP”
안전 → “SF”,  소방 →“FF”,  판매 → “SL”, 의료 → “MD”
주거 →“HS”, 업무 →“BS”, 관리 → “MN”, 구조 → “IS”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="7">⑦구조(CLASSIFY)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="7"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="7">2</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="7">공간 → “RM”, 시설물 → “FC”, 천정 → “CL”, 벽 → “WL”, 
바닥 → “FL”, 문 → “DR”, 창문 → “WD”, 기둥 → “PL”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="8">⑧세부항목(KIND)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="8"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="8">50</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="8">“카페”, “식당”, “소화전”, “공중전화” 등</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="9">⑨세부항목_영문(KANDENG)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="9"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="9">100</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="9">“CAFE”, “RESTAURANT” 등</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="10">⑩일련번호(SERIAL)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="10"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="10">5</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="10">“00001”, “00002”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="11">⑩명칭(NAME)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="11"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="11">50</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="11">“스타벅스”, “김밥천국”
시설물의 경우 현재층_공간(+_시설명) &quot;1층_복도_소화전&quot;
객석/좌석일 경우 객석번호 입력</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="12">⑫재질(QAL)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="12"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="12">6</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="12">미분류 → “QAL000”, 방화 → “QALQ001”, 유리 → “QAL002”, 
철재 → “QAL003”, 나무 → “QAL004”, 콘크리트 → “QAL005, 
종이 → “QAL006”, 플라스틱 → “QAL007”, 기타 → “QAL999”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="13">⑬경사(SLP)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="13"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="13">6</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="13">미분류 → “SLP000”, 경사로없음 → “SLP001”, 
휠체어경사로 → “SLP002”, 자전거경사로 → “SLP003”,
통합경사로 → “SLP004”, 기타 → “SLP999”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="14">⑭진행방향(DIR)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="14"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="14">6</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="14">미분류 → “DIR000”, 상행 → “DIR001”, 하행 → “DIR002”,
양방향 → “DIR003”, 기타 → “DIR999”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="15">⑮내외부(SKT)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="15"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="15">6</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="15">미분류 → “SKT000”, 내부 → “SKT001”, 외부 → “SKT002”
기타 → “SKT999”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="16">⑯교통약자(HANDICAP)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="16"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="16">6</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="16">교통약자 이동가능 → “HCP000”, 교통약자 전용 → “HCP001”, 교통약자 이동불가 → “HCP002”</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="17">⑰첫번째점(FPOINT)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="17"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="17">36</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="17">경로연결 시작 지점 PRIMARY KEY 값</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="18">⑱두번째점(SPOINT)</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="18"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="18">36</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="18">경로연결 끝 지점 PRIMARY KEY 값</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell col="0" row="19">⑯기타</cell>
      <cell col="1" row="19"></cell>
      <cell col="2" row="19">50</cell>
      <cell col="3" row="19"></cell>
    </row>
  </table>
